      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "reading-20261110:webb:sunshield-purpose",
    "target": {
      "id": "u3:fbaa9ee12f288cfa:record:5266d210bef739fd01c7",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "role": "importance",
    "english": "To observe faint infrared light, Webb needs to stay very cold. The five-layer sunshield blocks light and heat from the Sun, Earth and Moon so the instruments can reach the temperatures needed for observation.",
    "content": {
      "kind": "note",
      "subjectId": "u3:fbaa9ee12f288cfa:entity:e7a84d267f62548ef726",
      "assertion": "かすかな赤外線を観測するには、望遠鏡を十分に冷やす必要がある。5層の遮熱膜は太陽・地球・月の光と熱を遮り、観測機器が必要な低温に達するのを助ける。",
      "textLanguages": {
        "assertion": {
          "tag": "ja",
          "basis": "declared"
        }
      },
      "aboutRecord": {
        "id": "u3:fbaa9ee12f288cfa:record:5266d210bef739fd01c7",
        "revision": 1
      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "id": "evidence-main",
          "source": {
            "id": "u3:fbaa9ee12f288cfa:source:9cc89cda1ef7ab1b9ddb",
            "revision": 1
          },
          "locator": "Paragraphs on the five layers and 40 kelvins, RELEASE 22-002",
          "excerpt": "",
          "stance": "support"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "reading-20261110:webb:sunshield-next-steps",
    "target": {
      "id": "u3:fbaa9ee12f288cfa:record:5266d210bef739fd01c7",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "role": "insight",
    "english": "Unfolding the sunshield did not mean science observations could begin immediately. Mirror deployment, optical alignment and instrument calibration still lay ahead.",
    "content": {
      "kind": "note",
      "subjectId": "u3:fbaa9ee12f288cfa:entity:e7a84d267f62548ef726",
      "assertion": "遮熱膜が開いても、すぐに観測が始まるわけではない。鏡の展開、光学系の調整、観測機器の較正が続く。",
      "textLanguages": {
        "assertion": {
          "tag": "ja",
          "basis": "declared"
        }
      },
      "aboutRecord": {
        "id": "u3:fbaa9ee12f288cfa:record:5266d210bef739fd01c7",
        "revision": 1
      },
